{"id":"76f6b51c29b04bc9d15acf40ddb5b27977572af7","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238180","title":"GPT 额度不够的可以试度这个方法","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"sskycn","excerpt":"OpenAI - @sskycn - 网页版 gpt 直接连 github 写代码，又快又好，还不消耗 codex 额度，不知道这个 bug 什么时候修复。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>网页版 gpt 直接连 github 写代码，又快又好，还不消耗 codex 额度，不知道这个 bug 什么时候修复。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031503\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6a1/2393/233073_normal.png?m=1572831959\" alt=\"heyjei\" data-uid=\"233073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heyjei\">heyjei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 17:32:48 +08:00\">23h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>怎么测试呢？我有时觉得网页版的 GPT 智商要更高些。</p><p>这个其实不是 bug ，这是 feature 。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031514\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51d9/fe87/117741_normal.png?m=1783257267\" alt=\"sskycn\" data-uid=\"117741\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sskycn\">sskycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 17:42:41 +08:00\">22h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>你让 gpt 连接 github ，它就会告诉你怎么做了。</p><p>不过也得省着点用，上周就有人说被限额了，应该是网页版的额度用光了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031627\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e9df3812a997f3f22ee335fa1bbc5a84?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"shuijingwanwqyy\" data-uid=\"808002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shuijingwanwqyy\">shuijingwanwqyy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 19:25:25 +08:00\">21h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这个我曾经尝试过了。最终还是决定只让 ChatGPT 读取 Github 了。至于写代码，还是交给 Codex 吧。可能是因为前一段时间 5.6 降智到 5.5 吧，反正让其操作 Github ，是只说不做了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031630\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a7b3d29c2b6e3e5cc534ac8c1b1bf49c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fantasynoff\" data-uid=\"260660\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fantasynoff\">fantasynoff</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 19:27:51 +08:00\">21h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>GPT:<br>测试结果出来了：<br>不能提交。</p><p>我成功读取了 requirements.txt ，当前内容就是：<br>xxxxxxxx</p><p>然后我尝试通过当前 GitHub 连接器直接修改 main 并提交，GitHub 返回：<br>403 — Resource not accessible by integration</p><p>所以现在可以明确区分：<br>读取权限：✅<br>写入/Commit 权限：❌</p><p>===========<br>实测没成功,也许跟 codex free 额度为零有关?</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031643\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51d9/fe87/117741_normal.png?m=1783257267\" alt=\"sskycn\" data-uid=\"117741\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sskycn\">sskycn</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 19:36:38 +08:00\">20h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我用 pro 和 plus 测试都是可以的，会提交很多 commit ，速度比用 macmini 还要快得多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031645\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 19:37:20 +08:00\">20h 58m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a> plus 和免费用户好像不能自定义 mcp 吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031834\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ee92fc40a6c8ab3e4ebba24675b6e8e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vultr\" data-uid=\"188988\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vultr\">vultr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 21:27:11 +08:00\">19h 8m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大家都这样玩，很快就会修复的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031836\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 21:29:22 +08:00\">19h 6m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a> 真的假的，我问 chatGPT：<br>chatgpt plus 和用户可以自定义 mcp 吗？</p><p>它说：可以使用 ChatGPT 已提供的 Apps / Connectors ，但不能自己填 MCP Server 地址</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18031889\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4676b54daa0f44b885474248e64b6972?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ntdll\" data-uid=\"148771\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ntdll\">ntdll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 21:59:52 +08:00\">18h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>这个方案我试过，不确定是触发了风控还是什么原因，网络依旧是通的，然后网页版 GPT 会提示 plugin 'xxx' is disabled. 但是我看网页上显示状态是正常的，也是 connected 。</p><p>我发起 refersh ，也能正常获取到信息。看起来就是网页版 GPT 的 runtime 里禁止调用我自己的这个 mcp 了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18032006\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 22:58:29 +08:00\">17h 36m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a> 不过没什么用，plus 网页聊天跟 codex 共享模型额度，我现在桌面端到达了 5 小时限额，只能用 5.6luna reserve 了，网页版也是。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18032032\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0f43/8d67/631098_normal.png?m=1699438635\" alt=\"dayear\" data-uid=\"631098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 23:17:46 +08:00\">17h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a> 不是共享的，是独立的，我现在 Codex 额度是 0 ，但是依旧可以用 Sol High ，只有 Work 是共享的，Chat 是独立的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18032048\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 23:26:27 +08:00\">17h 8m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a> 这太奇怪了，我的网页版就用不了 sol<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/3qxwIuB.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3qxwIuB.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18032055\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0f43/8d67/631098_normal.png?m=1699438635\" alt=\"dayear\" data-uid=\"631098\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dayear\">dayear</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 23:28:39 +08:00\">17h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a> 你用的是工作，你开一个新对话，对话顶部可以切换“聊天”/“工作”，你切换到“聊天”即可</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18032062\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-30 23:31:17 +08:00\">17h 4m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我知道了，我切到 work 去了，回归聊天就可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"网页版 gpt 直接连 github 写代码，又快又好，还不消耗 codex 额度，不知道这个 bug 什么时候修复。 1 heyjei 23h 2m ago 怎么测试呢？我有时觉得网页版的 GPT 智商要更高些。这个其实不是 bug ，这是 feature 。 2 sskycn OP 22h 52m ago 你让 gpt 连接 github ，它就会告诉你怎么做了。不过也得省着点用，上周就有人说被限额了，应该是网页版的额度用光了。 3 shuijingwanwqyy 21h 9m ago 这个我曾经尝试过了。最终还是决定只让 ChatGPT 读取 Github 了。至于写代码，还是交给 Codex 吧。可能是因为前一段时间 5.6 降智到 5.5 吧，反正让其操作 Github ，是只说不做了。 4 fantasynoff 21h 7m ago GPT:测试结果出来了：不能提交。我成功读取了 requirements.txt ，当前内容就是：xxxxxxxx然后我尝试通过当前 GitHub 连接器直接修改 main 并提交，GitHub 返回：403 — Resource not 